{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"The key understanding here is that you can factor a monomial in many different ways!\n\nTo check if any of the factorizations is correct, we can multiply the factors and see if their product is really $14y^3$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n(\\blueD{7}\\maroonD{y^2})(\\blueD{2}\\maroonD{y})\u0026=(\\blueD{7})(\\blueD{2})(\\maroonD{y^2})(\\maroonD{y})\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\blueD{14}\\maroonD{y^3}\n\\end{align}$\n\nSo Hiro is correct!","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n(\\blueD{10}\\maroonD{y})(\\blueD{4}\\maroonD{y^2})\u0026=(\\blueD{10})(\\blueD{4})(\\maroonD{y})(\\maroonD{y^2})\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\blueD{40}\\maroonD{y^3}\n\\end{align}$\n\nSo Bilal is not correct!","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Only Hiro is correct.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"Hiro factored $14y^3$ as $(7y^2)(2y)$.\n\nBilal factored $14y^3$ as $(10y)(4y^2)$.\n\n**Which of them factored $14y^3$ correctly?\n**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"Only Hiro","correct":true},{"content":"Only Bilal","correct":false},{"content":"Both Hiro and Bilal","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"content":"Neither Hiro nor Bilal","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":false,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":false,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
